This CDr (Promo) for the <i>Hannah Montana</i> soundtrack features the English-language pop anthems that launched Miley Cyrus to global superstardom.<br>
Promotional CDrs like this were distributed to radio stations ahead of the album's official release to build hype. They generally feature the flagship English vocals from the first season.<br>




